WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.410
- I'm not trying to be rude, Rossy,

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:04.313
but I think mine looks more
like a swan than yours.

00:00:04.313 --> 00:00:06.950
(Drew laughing)
(audience laughing)

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.700
- Dear, it's time to
get your eyes checked,

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.410
all right?
(audience laughing)

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:14.040
- But mine looks like a duck.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.780
Oh my God. I'm holding the wrong one.

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.213
I'm looking at yours.

00:00:19.213 --> 00:00:22.637
(audience laughing)

00:00:22.637 --> 00:00:26.200
- I'm holding...
(audience applauding)

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.420
- [Ross] You were looking at
mine thinking it was yours?

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.670
No, this is me. That's you.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.447
- Oh my God. I was like,

00:00:32.447 --> 00:00:34.413
"Mine's so much better than yours, Rossy."

00:00:34.413 --> 00:00:37.150
Oh my God, I'm having the
moment, like in a workout class,

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:38.357
when you're in the mirror and you're like,

00:00:38.357 --> 00:00:39.517
"Damn, I look good," and you're like,

00:00:39.517 --> 00:00:41.110
"That's not me, that's her."

